'''Bridal Princess Punt''' (ウェディングケリ姫, ''Uedingu Kerihime'', '''Wedding Kerihime''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Bridal Princess Punt
|image = E 334.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Bridal Princess Punt has rather fast movement speed of 35 with her Area Attacks that reach up to a massive 1300 range, compounded by her 100% chance to cause [[Knockback|knockback]] and full backswing cooldown. Her singular knockback and low health however means she could barely push on her own and relies on other threats to actually advance.

==Strategy==
Fast Cats such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]], [[Capsule Cat (Special Cat)|Capsule Cat]], [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Sanada Yukimura]], Awakened Bahamut, [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]'s variants, etc. are all effective against the Princess.

